  "body": "B, & C - 3 Bedroom 2.5 Bathrooms with singe garage Double storey \r\nD - 4 Bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms with singe garage triple storey\r\n\r\n\r\nThis three-story duplex homes offer more space with approximately 154m² of floor area. This 4 bedrooms 2 bathrooms home come with an internal single garage.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n* Expansive open-plan living and dining areas\r\n* High-end kitchen with Smeg appliances\r\n* Private outdoor spaces with decks\r\n* Double glazed windows and full insulation\r\n* LED lighting throughout\r\n* Underfloor heating in the bathroom\r\n* High-quality fixtures and fittings\r\n\r\nAdditional Features for All Lots:\r\n\r\n* Freehold title with no Body Corporate fee\r\n* Zoned for excellent schools including Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, and Rangitoto College\r\n* Close proximity to public transport, local amenities, and a 400-meter walking distance to beautiful beaches This is your chance to own a brand-new home in the sought after Rothesay Bay area. Enjoy the perfect coastal lifestyle with easy access to local cafes, restaurants, and stunning beaches.\r\n\r\nPlease call us to book a private viewing or come through the\r\nopen home on weekend",
